#. English: Another package manager is busy right now. Close it (or wait for it), then try again.
msgid "task_err_locked"
msgstr "Otro gestor de paquetes está ocupado. Ciérralo (o espera) y vuelve a intentarlo."

#. English: Couldn't download it - check your internet connection and try again.
msgid "task_err_network"
msgstr "No se pudo descargar: revisa tu conexión a internet y vuelve a intentarlo."

#. English: No password window could be shown - your desktop has no polkit authentication agent running, so nothing was changed.
msgid "task_err_no_agent"
msgstr "No se pudo mostrar la ventana de contraseña: no hay ningún agente de autenticación polkit en marcha, así que no se cambió nada."

#. English: Your repositories don't have this package.
msgid "task_err_not_found"
msgstr "Tus repositorios no tienen este paquete."

#. English: Your repositories don't have this package - install it as a Flatpak instead.
