msgstr "Tus repositorios no tienen este paquete: instálalo como Flatpak."

#. English: The password window was closed, so nothing was changed.
msgid "task_err_password"
msgstr "Se cerró la ventana de contraseña, así que no se cambió nada."

#. English: Other installed software still needs it, so it can't be removed.
