#. English: From the AUR - built on this computer with {tool}, then installed with pacman. Updates with the rest of your system.
msgid "task_native_aur_desc"
msgstr "Desde el AUR: se compila en este equipo con {tool} y se instala con pacman. Se actualiza con el resto del sistema."

#. English: It needs packages that are only in the AUR ({deps}), which makepkg can't fetch on its own - install paru or yay first, or install it as a Flatpak instead.
msgid "task_native_aur_needs_helper"
msgstr "Necesita paquetes que solo están en el AUR ({deps}) y que makepkg no puede conseguir por sí solo: instala primero paru o yay, o instálalo como Flatpak."

#. English: It needs packages that are only in the AUR ({deps}), which makepkg can't fetch on its own - install paru or yay first.
msgid "task_native_aur_needs_helper_noflat"
msgstr "Necesita paquetes que solo están en el AUR ({deps}) y que makepkg no puede conseguir por sí solo: instala primero paru o yay."

#. English: Checking availability…
msgid "task_native_checking"
msgstr "Comprobando disponibilidad…"

#. English: Also installs {packages}, for 32-bit games.
msgid "task_native_extras"
msgstr "También instala {packages}, para juegos de 32 bits."

#. English: Steam is in the contrib and non-free components, which aren't switched on. Enable them in your APT sources - or install Steam as a Flatpak.
msgid "task_native_hint_contrib"
msgstr "Steam está en los componentes contrib y non-free, que no están activados. Actívalos en tus fuentes de APT, o instala Steam como Flatpak."

#. English: Steam is in the multilib repository, which isn't switched on. Enable it in /etc/pacman.conf - or install Steam as a Flatpak.
msgid "task_native_hint_multilib"
msgstr "Steam está en el repositorio multilib, que no está activado. Actívalo en /etc/pacman.conf, o instala Steam como Flatpak."

#. English: Steam is in the multiverse repository, which isn't switched on. Enable it (Software & Updates) - or install Steam as a Flatpak.
msgid "task_native_hint_multiverse"
msgstr "Steam está en el repositorio multiverse, que no está activado. Actívalo (Software y actualizaciones), o instala Steam como Flatpak."

#. English: Steam is in the Non-OSS repository, which isn't switched on. Enable it in YaST - or install Steam as a Flatpak.
msgid "task_native_hint_nonoss"
msgstr "Steam está en el repositorio Non-OSS, que no está activado. Actívalo en YaST, o instala Steam como Flatpak."

#. English: {system} keeps its system read-only, so system packages can't be installed from here - install it as a Flatpak instead.
msgid "task_native_immutable"
msgstr "{system} mantiene el sistema de solo lectura, así que aquí no se pueden instalar paquetes del sistema: instálalo como Flatpak."

#. English: {system} keeps its system read-only, so system packages can't be installed from here - your system's own tools (rpm-ostree, ujust...) do that.
msgid "task_native_immutable_noflat"
msgstr "{system} mantiene el sistema de solo lectura, así que aquí no se pueden instalar paquetes del sistema: lo hacen las herramientas propias del sistema (rpm-ostree, ujust...)."

#. English: This driver is built for your kernel, but its headers aren't installed - install your kernel's headers package first.
msgid "task_native_no_headers"
msgstr "Este controlador se compila para tu kernel, pero sus headers no están instalados: instala primero el paquete de headers de tu kernel."

#. English: This needs pkexec (polkit), which isn't installed. Install it - or choose the Flatpak.
msgid "task_native_no_pkexec"
msgstr "Necesita pkexec (polkit), que no está instalado. Instálalo, o elige Flatpak."

#. English: This needs pkexec (polkit), which isn't installed.
msgid "task_native_no_pkexec_noflat"
msgstr "Necesita pkexec (polkit), que no está instalado."

